<h1>Your withdrawal has been completed</h1>

<p>Hi <%= @user.full_name %>,</p>

<p>
  Your withdrawal of <%= @withdrawal.amount %> BTC to
  <code><%= @withdrawal.btc_address %></code> has been sent and is now complete.
</p>

<ul>
  <li>Transaction hash: <%= @withdrawal.transaction_hash %></li>
  <li>Completed at: <%= @withdrawal.completed_at %></li>
</ul>

<p>
  You can view your wallet activity at any time:
  <%= link_to "View wallet activity", wallet_activity_url %>
</p>

<p>Thank you for investing with us.</p>
